WEBVTT

00:05:29.204 --> 00:05:32.746
That is on average, people are
on the positive side of zero.

00:05:34.079 --> 00:05:38.704
Now, look at, say, the 10 percent of the
time that people spend suffering.

00:05:39.871 --> 00:05:46.954
Overall, most of the suffering is
concentrated in about 10 to 15 percent of

00:05:46.954 --> 00:05:52.163
the population. So it actually is not

00:05:52.163 --> 00:05:56.413
the same people that you would make
less miserable or happier.

00:05:56.621 --> 00:05:58.496
Those are different populations.

00:05:58.663 --> 00:06:03.704
And the question is, where do you
direct the the weight of policy